{"id":"carriera","lemma":"carriera","pos":"noun","rank":929,"glosses":["career","the fastest gait (both senses)"],"ipa":"/karˈrjɛ.ra/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"carriere"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/87/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-XANA000-carriera.wav","examples":[{"text":"Parliamo della tua carriera.","en":"Let's talk about your career.","words":[{"g":"to talk, to speak","l":"parlare"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"yours","l":"tuo"},null]},{"text":"Perché hai scelto questa carriera?","en":"Why did you choose this career?","words":[{"g":"why / because"},{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"chosen"},{"g":"this, this one, these","l":"questo"},null]},{"text":"Sto pensando di cambiare carriera.","en":"I'm thinking about changing careers.","words":[{"g":"to stay, remain","l":"stare"},{"g":"to think","l":"pensare"},{"g":"of"},{"g":"to exchange"},null]},{"text":"La sua carriera politica è finita.","en":"Her political career has ended.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"his, hers, its","l":"suo"},null,{"g":"politics"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"finished","l":"finito"}]},{"text":"Ho la mia carriera a cui pensare.","en":"I have my career to think of.","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"mine","l":"mio"},null,{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"whose"},{"g":"to think"}]}]}